# r1115 phase 5 (runner-5), boot A1 (= O2): the p5_o1.qb world rebooted on the installed mods/ jars (NOSWAP=1).
# SQ-HOP / Hearth and Harvest hops, tilled end stone, stomping basin (scratch_queue.md), group A rows; SQ-MELT-09b
# full-pack half (Rare Ice present); SQ-MELT-P1b (perf, last two rows plus the config-reload row).
# Server: the p5_o1 OUT dir, srv/mods/creativedelight-1.1.0.jar replaced by a hard link of mods/creativedelight-1.1.0.jar.
# Probes in OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/: zz_zq_probe.js (prep_srv.sh), zz_hh2.js (hh_mw_probe.js), zz_hh5.js
#   (hh_gear_probe.js), zz_zmelt.js (zmelt_probe.js: generic per-tick block watcher, used for growth too).
# Superflat: ground top y -61, stand at -60. Bots G (hops plots x 600..660 z 520) and hb1 (basin plots).
pace 1

## P5-setup | gamerules, forceloads, season, bots (not a test row)
bootexpect Done \(
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> gamerule doFireTick false
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> time set noon
> weather clear 1000000
> season set MID_AUTUMN
> forceload add 576 496 671 559
> forceload add 160 192 335 223
sleep 5
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> pbot spawn G 615 -60 512 minecraft:overworld survival
> pbot spawn hb1 178 -60 204 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> clear G
> clear hb1
> zhh5 hand G
waitlog \[zhh5\] hand id=minecraft:air 20
reject (Unknown or incomplete command|Enum constant must be one of)
look season set to mid autumn; bots online; hand air

## SQ-HOP-11 | old save: H&H hops load as Vinery lattices (age, facing kept), grape back to hops after a random tick; H&H tilled end stone loads as Ender Crop's
bootexpect \[swaps\] minecraft:block: 2 id\(s\) remapped
shell grep -E "\[swaps\]" logs/latest.log | sed -E 's/^.*\]: //' | head -8
> execute if block 620 -60 521 vinery:grapevine_lattice[age=4,facing=south] run say HOP11-620-lattice-age4
> execute if block 622 -60 521 vinery:grapevine_lattice[age=2,facing=south] run say HOP11-622-lattice-age2
> zmelt w hop11_620 overworld 620 -60 521
> zmelt w hop11_622 overworld 622 -60 521
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3000
sleep 5
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block 620 -60 521 vinery:grapevine_lattice[grape=hops] run say HOP11-620-grape-hops
> execute if block 622 -60 521 vinery:grapevine_lattice[grape=hops] run say HOP11-622-grape-hops
> zmelt show
> zmelt clear
expect HOP11-620-lattice-age4$
expect HOP11-622-lattice-age2$
expect HOP11-620-grape-hops$
expect HOP11-622-grape-hops$
look swap line "minecraft:block: 2 id(s) remapped"; both lattices kept age and facing, grape=hops after the random ticks (watch lines show the states)

## SQ-HH-1546b | old save: H&H tilled end stone at 624 -61 520 loads as endercrop:tilled_end_stone
> execute if block 624 -61 520 endercrop:tilled_end_stone run say HH1546b-ender-tes
expect HH1546b-ender-tes$
