## SQ-HOP-10x | registry: no H&H lattice and no hearthandharvest:hops block; hops items present (full pack, positive control for SQ-HOP-01)
> zq blocks hearthandharvest:
waitlog \[zq\] blocks matching hearthandharvest:: \d+ 30
> zq items hearthandharvest:hops
waitlog \[zq\] items matching hearthandharvest:hops: \d+ 30
> zq items hearthandharvest:wild_hops
> zq blocks hearthandharvest:hops
reject \[zq\] blocks id hearthandharvest:[a-z_]*lattice
reject \[zq\] blocks id hearthandharvest:hops class
expect \[zq\] items id hearthandharvest:hops class
look items list hearthandharvest:hops, hops_salad, hops_bag (and wild_hops?); blocks: hops_vine (and hops_bag?) only, no lattice, no hearthandharvest:hops block

## SQ-HOP-02 | hops item on a log face places a hops vine (north=true, age 0); one hops used
> setblock 600 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> clear G
> pbot hold G hearthandharvest:hops 2
> pbot use G 600 -60 520 south
> execute if block 600 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=0] run say HOP02-vine
> zhh5 hand G
waitlog \[zhh5\] done 20
expect HOP02-vine$
expect \[zhh5\] hand id=hearthandharvest:hops count=1 
look "Test passed"; hand count 1

