## SQ-HOP-04 | stick pick: age 3 gives 1 or 2 hops and goes to age 1 (x3); age 2 gives 0 or 1; age 1 is not picked
> setblock 604 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> clear G
> pbot hold G minecraft:stick 1
repeat 3
> setblock 604 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=3]
> pbot use G 604 -60 521 north
> execute if block 604 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[age=1] run say HOP04-age3-to-1
> zhh5 items 604 -60 521 3
sleep 1
end
> setblock 604 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=2]
> pbot use G 604 -60 521 north
> execute if block 604 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[age=1] run say HOP04-age2-to-1
> zhh5 items 604 -60 521 3
> setblock 604 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=1]
> pbot use G 604 -60 521 north
> execute if block 604 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[age=1] run say HOP04-age1-stays
> zhh5 items 604 -60 521 3
count HOP04-age3-to-1$ == 3
look per use: "use SUCCESS/CONSUME" lines; age 3 items lines 1 or 2 hearthandharvest:hops each; age 2 line 0 or 1 hops (age 1 after); age 1 use PASS/FAIL and no items

## SQ-HOP-05 | shears sterilize: no growth while sterilized; second shears use clears it
> setblock 606 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> setblock 606 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=1]
> clear G
> pbot hold G minecraft:shears 1
> pbot use G 606 -60 521 north
> execute if block 606 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[sterilized=true] run say HOP05-sterilized
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3000
sleep 10
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block 606 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[age=1] run say HOP05-still-age1
> pbot use G 606 -60 521 north
> execute if block 606 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[sterilized=false] run say HOP05-unsterilized
expect HOP05-sterilized$
expect HOP05-still-age1$
expect HOP05-unsterilized$
look three "Test passed"

