## SQ-HH-266 | rerun: water fill/empty with a bucket; then empty basin: bucket, dirt and a hopper's dirt and bucket stay out of the slots
> clear hb1
> tp hb1 178.5 -59 206.5 0 60
> setblock 176 -60 208 hearthandharvest:stomping_basin[facing=north]
> zhh2 fill 176 -60 208 minecraft:water 1000
> zhh2 tank 176 -60 208
> pbot hold hb1 minecraft:bucket
> pbot use hb1 176 -60 208 up
> data get entity hb1 SelectedItem.id
> zhh2 tank 176 -60 208
> clear hb1
> pbot hold hb1 minecraft:bucket
> pbot use hb1 176 -60 208 up
> data get entity hb1 SelectedItem
> pbot hold hb1 minecraft:dirt 4
> pbot use hb1 176 -60 208 up
> data get entity hb1 SelectedItem
> zhh2 basin 176 -60 208
> setblock 176 -59 208 minecraft:hopper[facing=down]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:dirt",Count:4b},{Slot:1b,id:"minecraft:bucket",Count:1b}]}
sleep 3
> zhh2 basin 176 -60 208
> data get block 176 -59 208 Items
look fill 1000; first bucket use: hand water_bucket, tank empty; empty basin: hand still bucket, then hand still 4 dirt; basin slots empty after hand and hopper; hopper still holds 4 dirt and the bucket

