## SQ-MELT-09b-full | full pack, Rare Ice present: no skip or error line for RareIceLightMeltMixin; Rare Ice's ice (roofed, beside a sea lantern, light 14) does not light-melt
bootreject (?i)RareIceLightMeltMixin|rareice.*(Error loading class|not found|skipp)
shell ls mods | grep -i rare; grep -ciE "rare.?ice" logs/latest.log; grep -iE "rare.?ice" logs/latest.log | sed -E 's/^.*\]: //' | cut -c1-200 | head -5
> zq blocks minecraft:ice
waitlog \[zq\] blocks matching minecraft:ice: \d+ 30
> forceload add 2400 2400 2431 2431
sleep 3
> pbot spawn m5r 2416 -60 2410 minecraft:overworld survival
> fill 2410 -61 2416 2414 -58 2420 minecraft:stone
> setblock 2412 -60 2418 minecraft:ice
> setblock 2413 -60 2418 minecraft:sea_lantern
> setblock 2411 -60 2418 minecraft:ice
> setblock 2412 -60 2417 minecraft:air
> setblock 2412 -60 2419 minecraft:air
> zmelt light overworld 2412 -60 2417
> zmelt w m09b_ice_lantern overworld 2412 -60 2418
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 1000
sleep 60
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block 2412 -60 2418 minecraft:ice run say MELT09b-lantern-ice-kept
> zmelt show
> zmelt clear
expect MELT09b-lantern-ice-kept$
look minecraft:ice block class is Rare Ice's (me.shedaniel.rareice...); no Rare Ice mixin error in the boot log; roofed lantern ice kept (vanillaLightMelting false reaches Rare Ice's randomTick: the redirect applies)
